        </div>

        <div class="philosophy-grid">
          <div class="philosophy-item">
            <h3>Children First</h3>
            <p>Every administrative decision prioritizes pupil safety, emotional well-being, and learning needs.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="philosophy-item">
            <h3>Strong Foundations</h3>
            <p>Focusing on foundational literacy, numeracy, and character development in early childhood years.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="philosophy-item">
